  "description": "Silver positioning, market conditions, and the trade I’m taking",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Thursday! Please watch the video and like/re-stack. I make them so you don’t have to read (and I don’t have to type a lot! 😅)</p><p>Quick summary:</p><ul><li><p>S&amp;P 500 looks fine, along with the Russell 2000</p></li><li><p>The VIX is creeping upwards…but nothing to act on, at least not right now</p></li><li><p>The silver maximalists have went beyond happiness and euphoria to flat out arrogance. Historically when I see arrogance (a major benefit of being a creator, always being able to get direct sentiment analysis)…that is typically a warning signal. Sold off my Silver Mining company, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PAAS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> for a 30.6% gain. </p></li><li><p>The<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> continues to outperform the S&amp;P 500 and I am continuing to build the “lazy portfolio” for 2026. All of the stock picks were based off the monthly timeframes, so if you are looking for “set and forget”, this is the one. I have already purchased 3 stocks that can be found <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/going-shopping-3-finance-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">here</a>.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MSUb!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c916b02-641e-4799-bb14-4db6d522f9b9_1798x856.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MSUb!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c916b02-641e-4799-bb14-4db6d522f9b9_1798x856.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MSUb!,w_848,c_limit,f_